WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
today I built a slapping game and you are going to lose your mind

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.500
because this thing launches a county fair volunteer ninety meters

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.800
the whole thing runs on a four key kinetic chain you have to feel

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.400
swivel lunge arm palm that is the entire control scheme

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.000
and if you miss the timing you fall flat on your face

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.000
so let me show you the physics first because the physics are real

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.200
every joint is simulated and the ragdoll flies on real momentum

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.000
the ragdoll flies further when you hit the cheek dead flush

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.500
I spent a whole week tuning the balance model alone

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.000
a whole week and it was worth every minute

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.000
now the leaderboard is global so your scores actually matter

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and the weekly reset means everyone gets a fresh shot at the crown

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
go play it right now the link is in the description

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.000
and slap responsibly my friends
